{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lis …</p><p></p>\n<p>杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa的步伐，朝聖首爾弘大一間介紹片高達逾2,000萬點擊的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」！究竟這碗麵有何魔力？Helen更為一款人氣Gelato甘願排長龍，場面墟冚！<br/>\n</p>\n<h2>直擊弘大打卡熱點 杜如風實試Jisoo同款三文魚麵</h2>\n<p>今集杜如風跟隨網紅影片，來到位於弘大的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」朝聖。據報這間餐廳的介紹影片在網上點擊數高達逾2,000萬，連人氣女團BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa也是常客，人氣極高！餐廳的特色是以新鮮三文魚製成「刺身」麵條，名副其實啖啖肉。杜如風在節目中先後試食了「番茄三文魚麵」、「雪蟹味噌套餐」及「豪華蓋飯」，而且款款價值均十分相宜，絕對是粉絲必到的打卡點。</p>\n<h2>為食甘願排長龍 杜如風激讚杜拜朱古力麻糬Gelato</h2>\n<p>除了三文魚麵，杜如風亦到訪一間「超人氣排隊Gelato店」。為了品嚐店內名物「杜拜朱古力開心果麻糬Gelato」，她竟然也願意加入長長人龍排隊等食。這款Gelato據說能一啖集齊香、脆、煙韌三重豐富口感，令杜如風食完後也讚不絕口，大讚期待值爆燈，可見其魅力非凡。\n</p>\n<h2>網民瘋狂洗版：跟住BLACKPINK去食！</h2>\n<p>節目介紹的美食清單引發網民熱烈討論，不少人都表示要跟隨杜如風的腳步去朝聖。網民紛紛留言：「嘩！連Jisoo同Lisa都係常客，呢間一定要去！」、「三文魚變做麵條？好想知咩味！」、「個Gelato聽個名都覺得好正好邪惡！」、「多謝Helen介紹，下次去首爾有新目標！」、「睇見都流口水，今晚即刻想食三文魚！」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e8%a9%b1%e9%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊話題</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:22:33.700975+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":800,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:37.873310+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:07.259126+00:00","content_hash":"f07ed2f2dd0aa62fdc4ed7e303f0ff76e0fe0fd4da85e3ea390c371212d1426f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}